          docComment: '9.3.2. API Security.',
          classDocComment: '9.3.2. API Security.\n\nComprehensive API security specification covering authentication,\nauthorization, request validation, CORS policy, input sanitization,\nabuse prevention, and security monitoring. Aligned with OWASP API\nSecurity Top 10 (2023) and OWASP REST Security Cheat Sheet.',
          recursive: r,
          children: c)),
       _cx('FileAndStorageSecurity', s, _mc$FileAndStorageSecurity, (r, c) => SomMetaNode(
